      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e I can\u0027t reproduce the error locally.\n\nThe error occured while building the target files zip file. `m updatepackage` or `m dist` will trigger it.\n\n\u003e why TH is failing\n\nI think it\u0027s due to the way the signature files are generated [1]. They are generated as part of the packaging step (build_image.py). So, the files don\u0027t seem to be generated under the directory where the canned_fs_config is generated for. The canned_fs_config file is generated by scanning the directories and files under out/target/product/\u003cname\u003e/\u003cpartition\u003e/.\n\nI don\u0027t know how we can fix this, but it looks like we need to change the way the signature files are generated. (They should be moved out of build_image.py)\n\n[1] https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/build/+/1853604/11/tools/releasetools/build_image.py#487",
